against known-good input. When those fixtures are added, the following
attributions apply and must be retained in this file.

1. pynbs - https://github.com/OpenNBS/pynbs
   Copyright (c) Open Note Block Studio contributors
   Licensed under the MIT License.
   Used for: .nbs test fixtures (tests/resources/*.nbs) and their committed
   parsed-output golden snapshots (tests/snapshots/*.txt), as well as the
   minimal legacy/current song goldens.

2. nbs.js - https://github.com/OpenNBS/nbs.js
